    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor Online</strong> is a murder mystery and social deduction game inspired by classics like <i>Werewolf</i> and <i>Town of Salem</i>. In each match, players are assigned random roles within three competing factions: <strong>Civilians</strong> (good guys), <strong>Impostors</strong> (bad guys), and <strong>Zombies</strong> (infection).  Civilians win by eliminating all Impostors and Zombies, Impostors win by outnumbering  Civilians, and Zombies win if they're the last faction standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostors</strong> are the main murderers. Each night, they can see and communicate with one another  and select one player to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Investigators</strong> play a crucial role on the Civilians team. Each night, they can communicate and choose one player to investigate, revealing their role and guiding the team's strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jester</strong>\u00a0can either vote to kill a player each night or hide to conceal their identity from investigators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nurse</strong>\u00a0can inject players each night. Their injections heal players targeted by Impostors, but will kill any player after two non-consecutive treatments. Nurse can instantly eliminate Zombies with a single injection.<strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong> can infect one player each night to convert them to their team. However, they can't identify fellow Zombies, and accidentally targeting another Zombie results in that Zombie's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, all players gather to debate who they believe is guilty. Through voting, they can lynch a suspect. Civilians must collaborate with Investigators to eliminate the Impostors and Zombies to secure their victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Play online with 6 to 16 players. You can play with your friends or join other players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Written and vocal chat</strong>: Communication is key in Impostor Online, as you have to either accuse suspicious players or defend yourself against their accusations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple unique roles</strong>: Special roles and abilities across three competing factions \u2013 Civilians, Impostors, and Zombies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: Personalize your character from head to foot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and statistics</strong>: Earn experience points and rewards from every game you win. As you level up, unlock new titles and cosmetic items to showcase your rank and style.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor Online</strong> is a murder mystery and social deduction game inspired by classics like <i>Werewolf</i> and <i>Town of Salem</i>. In each match, players are assigned random roles within three competing factions: <strong>Civilians</strong> (good guys), <strong>Impostors</strong> (bad guys), and <strong>Zombies</strong> (infection).  Civilians win by eliminating all Impostors and Zombies, Impostors win by outnumbering  Civilians, and Zombies win if they're the last faction standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostors</strong> are the main murderers. Each night, they can see and communicate with one another  and select one player to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Investigators</strong> play a crucial role on the Civilians team. Each night, they can communicate and choose one player to investigate, revealing their role and guiding the team's strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/eca7476224e772ddfb4f3a60a4f30143.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jester</strong>\u00a0can either vote to kill a player each night or hide to conceal their identity from investigators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/6cfcf13640dec18c7175cf79552c74b5.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nurse</strong>\u00a0can inject players each night. Their injections heal players targeted by Impostors, but will kill any player after two non-consecutive treatments. Nurse can instantly eliminate Zombies with a single injection.<strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong> can infect one player each night to convert them to their team. However, they can't identify fellow Zombies, and accidentally targeting another Zombie results in that Zombie's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/638b2788e4640882c6886dcabb5a936f.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, all players gather to debate who they believe is guilty. Through voting, they can lynch a suspect. Civilians must collaborate with Investigators to eliminate the Impostors and Zombies to secure their victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.poster.avif?t=1746735193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.webm?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/ad5a6d8761902b5bd4e1a866e1e2fe2d.mp4?t=1746735193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Play online with 6 to 16 players. You can play with your friends or join other players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Written and vocal chat</strong>: Communication is key in Impostor Online, as you have to either accuse suspicious players or defend yourself against their accusations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple unique roles</strong>: Special roles and abilities across three competing factions \u2013 Civilians, Impostors, and Zombies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: Personalize your character from head to foot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and statistics</strong>: Earn experience points and rewards from every game you win. As you level up, unlock new titles and cosmetic items to showcase your rank and style.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by party games like Werewolf and Mafia, Impostor Online is a 6-16 player online game of murder, deception, and infection. Join friends and play as a Civilian, Impostor, Zombie, Nurse, Jester, or other unique characters to strategize your way to victory!",
